  Slug: full-moon-sarangay
  DisplayName: Full Moon Sarangay
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: You were raised in a shamanic tradition transcending a single sarangay
    community or heritage. You spent your youth under the guidance of a shaman elder,
    who taught you to commune with spirits in the hope that you'll one day use that
    knowledge to advise and guide your people. Those from your tradition are priests
    or shamans who channel the spirits and see things others can't. You gain an ancestry
    attribute boost to Wisdom instead of Strength, and you gain an attribute flaw
    in Constitution instead of Wisdom. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Folk
    Healer] ancestry feat.
